ed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  28 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 11 27 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm fibrofatty tissue  It is inked and sectioned to reveal REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm ill defined  tan white  firm area with puckering  approaching an inked resection margin  The remaining breast parenchyma is fibrous  A section of the mass is frozen as FX  1  now in A  Additional sections of the mass submitted in cassettes B through F  A section of uninvolved breast parenchyma has been submitted in cassette G  Resident  DANIELLE ELLIOTT  M D      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  LEFT   BIOPSY  INVASIVE MAMMARY CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  CHIN LEE WU  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Jacqueline Haas  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Core_biopsy.
